# Patrice Lumumba (Congo)
# php artisan prisoner:add '{"name": "Patrice Lumumba", "first_name": "Patrice", "last_name": "Lumumba", "description": "First elected prime minister of the Congo, deposed with CIA backing in 1960, taken prisoner and killed in 1961; The Black Panther Vol. 14 no.2 (1975) reports the U.S. Senate Select Committee'\''s revelation of a CIA plot to poison him. [Source: The Black Panther (Black Panther Party newspaper), v14 no.2; digitized at marxists.org — https://www.marxists.org/history/usa/pubs/black-panther/index.htm]"}'

